# Sequential vs Parallel Await Trap ⚠️

Don't await independent operations sequentially!

```javascript
// ❌ SLOW (Sequential): Takes 2s + 2s = 4 seconds total!
const user = await fetchUser();       // 2 seconds
const orders = await fetchOrders();   // 2 seconds

// ✅ FAST (Parallel): Takes only 2 seconds total!
const [user, orders] = await Promise.all([
  fetchUser(),
  fetchOrders()
]);
```

# Converting Callbacks to Promises 🔄

Wrap legacy callback APIs inside new Promises:

```javascript
function delay(ms) {
  return new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, ms));
}

// Clean sleep utility!
async function run() {
  console.log("Waiting 100ms...");
  await delay(100);
  console.log("Done waiting!");
}

run();
```

